    "title_zh": "明末：渊虚之羽",
    "summary_en": "I led environment art for Chapter 2, creating gameplay-ready scenes in Unreal Engine 5. Developed custom tools and Houdini procedural assets to streamline workflow, and optimized shaders and materials for both visual quality and performance.",
