  {
    "id": "work-1773670928515-xwnfap",
    "slug": "designer-friendly-no-code-tool-for-unreal-gas",
    "category": "tools",
    "title_en": "Designer-Friendly No-Code Tool for Unreal GAS",
    "title_zh": "面向设计师的虚幻 GAS 无代码配置工具",
    "summary_en": "A designer-friendly Unreal Engine GAS tool built with C++, Blueprints, and data tables, allowing attributes and Gameplay Effects to be configured in a more intuitive way while staying efficiently synchronized with the GAS system.",
    "summary_zh": "基于 C++、蓝图与数据表构建虚幻引擎 GAS 配置工具，让设计师能够以更直观的方式完成属性与 Gameplay Effect 配置，并保持与 GAS 系统的高效同步。",
