  {
    "id": "work-1772958339176-w527et",
    "slug": "genshin-style-character-rendering-in-unity-urp",
    "category": "shader",
    "title_en": "Genshin-Style Character Rendering in Unity URP",
    "title_zh": "Unity-URP-原神风格角色渲染",
    "summary_en": "This is a Genshin-style character rendering project built in Unity URP, using custom HLSL shaders for body and hair toon shading, face SDF shadows, and an outline system, with ILM masks, ramp textures, metallic highlights, and orientation vectors driving the overall lighting response.",
    "summary_zh": "这是一个基于 Unity URP 实现的原神风格角色渲染项目，使用自定义 HLSL Shader 完成身体与头发的 Toon Shading、脸部 SDF 阴影以及描边系统，并通过 ILM、Ramp、金属高光和方向向量控制角色的整体光影表现。",
    "cover": "/works-media/works/draft/1772958303338-kddsrn.png",
    "tags": [
      "Unity",
      "HLSL"
    ],
    "year": 2024,
    "sort_order": 1,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "b-1772958297775-rf59",
        "alt": "高光和面部SDF.png",
        "src": "/works-media/works/draft/1772958303338-kddsrn.png",
        "type": "Image",
        "width": "full",
        "caption": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "b-1772958219863-3mes",
        "src": "/works-media/works/draft/videos/1772958291792-ggxzel.mp4",
        "type": "Video",
        "width": "full",
        "poster": "",
        "caption": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "b-1772960516590-miqq",
        "alt": "高光和面部SDF实现.png",
        "src": "/works-media/works/work-1772958339176-w527et/1772960521684-f8g7ug.png",
        "type": "Image",
        "width": "full",
        "caption": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "b-1772960582506-ge29",
        "type": "Text",
        "align": "left",
        "width": "full",
        "content": "Hair Highlight: Uses a Blinn-Phong specular model combined with an ILM mask to control material regions, giving the hair clearer light response while preserving an anime-style flat look.\n\nFace SDF: Uses an SDF texture and character orientation vectors to control left-right facial shadow distribution, producing a more stable and art-directable anime face shading result.",
        "content_zh": "头发高光：通过 Blinn-Phong 高光结合 ILM Mask 控制材质区域，让头发在保持二次元平面感的同时拥有更清晰的受光层次。\n\n面部 SDF：使用 SDF 贴图与角色朝向向量控制左右脸阴影分布，以获得更稳定、更具美术可控性的二次元面部阴影效果。"
      },
      {
        "id": "b-1772960800343-muls",
        "alt": "描边.png",
        "src": "/works-media/works/work-1772958339176-w527et/1772960805664-tcwcij.png",
        "type": "Image",
        "width": "full",
        "caption": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "b-1772960807717-1u1o",
        "type": "Text",
        "align": "left",
        "width": "full",
        "content": "The outline system generates the character silhouette through normal extrusion and front-face culling, while using ILM alpha to classify outline colors across different material regions. This allows the outline to enhance character readability while also supporting the overall anime-style material language. The method is lightweight and efficient, though outline thickness is still affected by camera distance.",
        "content_zh": "描边系统通过法线外扩与 Front Cull 生成角色轮廓，并结合 ILM Alpha 对不同材质区域进行描边颜色分类，使轮廓在强化角色边缘识别度的同时，也能更好地服务整体二次元材质风格。该方案实现简单、性能开销较低，但描边宽度会受到镜头距离影响。"
      }
    ],
    "createdAt": "2026-03-08T08:25:37.8+00:00",
    "updatedAt": "2026-03-08T09:07:20.212+00:00"
  },
